        "note": "Imported as a dependency. Used: integral lattices from a Gram matrix with their level, determinant and real model; the Hecke–Schoeneberg transformation law of theta series under Γ₀(N) with the theta character trivial for a square discriminant; the corrected weight-two Eisenstein series E₂(z) − pE₂(pz) on Γ₀(p) with its q-expansion; and the criterion that at prime level a weight-two form minus the right Eisenstein multiple is a cusp form. New here: the level-11 lattice and its theta series as a form on Γ₀(11), the decomposition θ = Ẽ + c·f, and the congruence.",
